    Bill s2.2(1),(2),(4) amend Act 21 ss2, 3 and 5. The codification at f854aad omitted them, so enacted
    Act 26 had no effect on Act 21: it still required the verification record 'with the merge' with no
    fast-forward carve-out, left the suite-status timing unstated, and left the Judiciary audit without
    the hash-chain duty.
    
